{"id":"6fa80b05609c7b74","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-ground-horn-completeness.md","title":"有限Horn证明与后果阶段的精确对应","display":"thm-ground-horn-completeness — 有限Horn证明与后果阶段的精确对应","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-ground-horn-completeness","aliases":["72-thm-ground-horn-completeness"],"display":"thm-ground-horn-completeness — 有限Horn证明与后果阶段的精确对应","depends_on":["[[72-df-ground-horn-calculus]]","[[72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model]]","[[72-df-proof-height]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local induction proof for the positive-program fragment; not a claim of full SLDNF completeness","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-ground-horn-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-ground-horn-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ground-horn-completeness — 有限Horn证明与后果阶段的精确对应"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"20ce4fc55dd53d44\" href=\"?note=20ce4fc55dd53d44\" title=\"72-df-ground-horn-calculus\">72-df-ground-horn-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f07e41c114d4b890\" href=\"?note=f07e41c114d4b890\" title=\"72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model\">72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eaf2215780d904d4\" href=\"?note=eaf2215780d904d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-height\">72-df-proof-height</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local induction proof for the positive-program fragment; not a claim of full SLDNF completeness"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\mathcal H_P\">\\(P,\\mathcal H_P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\vdash_H A\">\\(P\\vdash_H A\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"20ce4fc55dd53d44\" href=\"?note=20ce4fc55dd53d44\" title=\"72-df-ground-horn-calculus\">72-df-ground-horn-calculus</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_n,I_\\omega\">\\(I_n,I_\\omega\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f07e41c114d4b890\" href=\"?note=f07e41c114d4b890\" title=\"72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model\">72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(\\pi)\">\\(h(\\pi)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"eaf2215780d904d4\" href=\"?note=eaf2215780d904d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-height\">72-df-proof-height</a>，叶节点高度为0。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in I_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal H_P}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=A\\land h(\\pi)&lt;n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in I_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal H_P}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=A\\land h(\\pi)&lt;n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P\\vdash_H A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\in I_\\omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P\\vdash_H A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\in I_\\omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P\\vdash_H A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall I\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma\\ (\\operatorname{HModel}_P(I)\\Rightarrow A\\in I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P\\vdash_H A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall I\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma\\ (\\operatorname{HModel}_P(I)\\Rightarrow A\\in I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 归纳。零阶段无原子且没有负高度证明。后继阶段的每个头由一个体的全部原子在前一阶段得到；归纳假设给每个前提有限证明，将它们接到对应Horn规则之上，高度小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span>。反向对最后规则：若是空体，高度0且头在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_1\">\\(I_1\\)</span>；否则各前提高度严格较小，故由归纳假设属于相应前一阶段。有限规则树高度总为自然数，取存在有限高度并用最小模型定理即得后两式。这不是对带负文字、合一搜索、公平性或失败分支的SLDNF结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-ground-horn-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"20ce4fc55dd53d44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-ground-horn-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model","status":"resolved","id":"f07e41c114d4b890","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-height","status":"resolved","id":"eaf2215780d904d4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-height]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-ground-horn-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"20ce4fc55dd53d44","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P,\\mathcal H_P$、$P\\vdash_H A$ 取 [[72-df-ground-horn-calculus]]；$I_n,I_\\omega$ 取 [[72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model","status":"resolved","id":"f07e41c114d4b890","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P,\\mathcal H_P$、$P\\vdash_H A$ 取 [[72-df-ground-horn-calculus]]；$I_n,I_\\omega$ 取 [[72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-height","status":"resolved","id":"eaf2215780d904d4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma$，$n\\in\\omega$；$h(\\pi)$ 取 [[72-df-proof-height]]，叶节点高度为0。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\mathcal H_P","display":false},{"tex":"P\\vdash_H A","display":false},{"tex":"I_n,I_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"h(\\pi)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in I_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal H_P}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=A\\land h(\\pi)<n).","display":true},{"tex":"P\\vdash_H A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\in I_\\omega.","display":true},{"tex":"P\\vdash_H A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall I\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma\\ (\\operatorname{HModel}_P(I)\\Rightarrow A\\in I).","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"I_1","display":false}],"bytes":20